---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About | Shivan Tillekeratne"
  description="About Shivan Tillekeratne, an AI Engineer with a background in artificial intelligence, software engineering, and applied AI research."
>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        About Me
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
        AI Engineer focused on building useful AI systems.
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        I am an AI Engineer with a background in artificial intelligence,
        software engineering, and applied AI research. I enjoy turning
        ideas and emerging AI techniques into practical systems that
        solve real-world problems.
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- Background -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          My Background
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-7 text-gray-600">
          <p>
            I completed my B.Sc. (Hons) in Artificial Intelligence at the
            University of Moratuwa in 2026. My academic journey gave me a
            strong foundation in artificial intelligence, machine learning,
            software engineering, and related computing disciplines.
          </p>

          <p>
            Alongside my academic work, I gained professional experience
            working on AI assistants, chatbots, automation platforms,
            natural language processing, prompt engineering, API
            integrations, and AI-driven software solutions.
          </p>

          <p>
            I currently work as an AI Engineer, where I continue to develop
            practical AI solutions while expanding my experience in
            production-oriented engineering.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>


      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          What Interests Me
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-7 text-gray-600">
          <p>
            My main interests are in artificial intelligence, machine
            learning, intelligent automation, AI assistants, and applied
            research.
          </p>

          <p>
            I am particularly interested in understanding how AI systems
            can move beyond experimentation and become reliable, useful
            tools for people and organizations.
          </p>

          <p>
            My longer-term goal is to continue growing as an AI/ML
            engineer and eventually pursue higher studies in an area of
            artificial intelligence that strongly interests me.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Education -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-100 pt-16">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Education
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        Academic Foundation
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-gray-200 pl-6">

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          B.Sc. (Hons) in Artificial Intelligence
        </h3>

        <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-gray-700">
          University of Moratuwa
        </p>

        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">
          Completed 2026
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-7 text-gray-600">
          Undergraduate degree focused on artificial intelligence,
          machine learning, software engineering, and the development
          of intelligent systems.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

</MainLayout>